WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.081 --> 00:00:01.493
- Ahhh.

00:00:01.493 --> 00:00:02.326
- Flat tire.

00:00:02.326 --> 00:00:04.249
- Yeah, I mean I can call my insurance--

00:00:04.249 --> 00:00:06.911
- Same.
- They'll be here in no time.

00:00:06.911 --> 00:00:07.744
- No service.

00:00:07.744 --> 00:00:09.978
- Yeah me neither.

00:00:09.978 --> 00:00:11.038
I mean we can change a tire.

00:00:11.038 --> 00:00:12.974
- Yeah, yeah, I change tires all the time.

00:00:12.974 --> 00:00:14.226
- Yeah I know how to change a tire.

00:00:14.226 --> 00:00:16.733
(upbeat electronic music)

00:00:16.733 --> 00:00:19.650
There should be some kind of lever.

00:00:20.775 --> 00:00:22.108
Ah, there we go!

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:24.855
- Where's the tire?

00:00:24.855 --> 00:00:26.554
- You know what, how about
you get started on the tire,

00:00:26.554 --> 00:00:28.689
I'll go check the engine and
make sure this puppy's running.

00:00:28.689 --> 00:00:31.218
Yeah, the flux capacitor is all messed up.

00:00:31.218 --> 00:00:32.556
- Do you think the hard drive crashed?

00:00:32.556 --> 00:00:33.440
- The hard drive looks good,

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.237
it's the soft drive that's making me mad.

00:00:35.237 --> 00:00:36.818
- Did you check the flask thindle?

00:00:36.818 --> 00:00:38.025
- Do you have a slam rod?

00:00:38.025 --> 00:00:39.830
- No, only a twist pole.

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:40.975
- Are you Lightning the McQueen?

00:00:40.975 --> 00:00:42.928
- Yeah, why do you think I
asked for the twist pole?

00:00:42.928 --> 00:00:44.723
When was the last time you
put Vin Diesel in this?

00:00:44.723 --> 00:00:46.000
- Did you Damon the Affleck?

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.309
- Do you have a jalopy bible?

00:00:47.309 --> 00:00:48.418
I feel like this would be a lot easier.

00:00:48.418 --> 00:00:49.467
- I don't think so.

00:00:49.467 --> 00:00:51.776
- God, if you could just
please fix this car,

00:00:51.776 --> 00:00:53.908
it'd be really solid of you.

00:00:53.908 --> 00:00:54.924
- Get us out of this mess,

00:00:54.924 --> 00:00:57.715
I'll never do anything bad again, I swear.

00:00:57.715 --> 00:00:58.928
I found the rubber wheel!

00:00:58.928 --> 00:00:59.761
- What kinda car is this?

00:00:59.761 --> 00:01:01.533
- A '67 Ford Coppola.

00:01:01.533 --> 00:01:03.047
- That's what I thought. Damn it!

00:01:03.047 --> 00:01:05.345
- Zach, are you eating grass?

00:01:05.345 --> 00:01:06.948
- I didn't have breakfast!

00:01:06.948 --> 00:01:08.768
So sorry if I'm a little hangry!

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:10.229
- Just a couple of oil buddies!

00:01:10.229 --> 00:01:11.935
- A couple dirty gas parrots!

00:01:11.935 --> 00:01:13.531
- This tire Y2K or B2K?

00:01:13.531 --> 00:01:15.503
- You think we should
just 76 the Chevron shop?

00:01:15.503 --> 00:01:18.021
Do you wanna go halfsies
in opening a shop with me?

00:01:18.021 --> 00:01:19.055
- Absolutely!

00:01:19.055 --> 00:01:20.543
(vomits)

00:01:20.543 --> 00:01:22.152
- Alright, I think I'm going
to cut the umbilical cord.

00:01:22.152 --> 00:01:24.628
- Ooh, make sure you don't
cut the fallopian tube.

00:01:24.628 --> 00:01:25.500
- I won't!

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.156
Can you just press the
car button real quick?

00:01:27.156 --> 00:01:28.442
- Car button, car button

00:01:28.442 --> 00:01:29.533
- Okay, now take it out of DRIV,

00:01:29.533 --> 00:01:30.431
put it into PAUSE.

00:01:30.431 --> 00:01:32.069
- Do you want me to
release the stop stick?

00:01:32.069 --> 00:01:32.902
- Car's totaled.

00:01:32.902 --> 00:01:33.810
- Snap out of it, man!

00:01:33.810 --> 00:01:35.518
Snap out of it!

00:01:35.518 --> 00:01:37.546
- No no no no no no no no no no!

00:01:37.546 --> 00:01:38.419
You know what's the problem?

00:01:38.419 --> 00:01:39.358
You drive too much Cruise control.

00:01:39.358 --> 00:01:40.317
- Oh, that's Risky Business.

00:01:40.317 --> 00:01:41.436
- Is it about to Rain, Man?

00:01:41.436 --> 00:01:43.004
- I dunno, looks like Vanilla Sky to me.

00:01:43.004 --> 00:01:43.996
- This Mission's Impossible.

00:01:43.996 --> 00:01:45.536
- Maybe I should file a Minority Report.

00:01:45.536 --> 00:01:47.189
- Or how about we just keep
it under Ghost Protocol?

00:01:47.189 --> 00:01:49.313
- Keep your Eyes Wide Shut,
we're gonna figure this out.

00:01:49.313 --> 00:01:50.561
- You know what, you're
right, we're A Few Good Men.

00:01:50.561 --> 00:01:52.091
You ever think about
what kinda wedding dress

00:01:52.091 --> 00:01:53.869
your wife's gonna wear one day?

00:01:53.869 --> 00:01:55.366
(sighs)

00:01:55.366 --> 00:01:56.330
- Every day.

00:01:56.330 --> 00:01:57.649
- Why are we stuck right now?

00:01:57.649 --> 00:01:58.994
Please just fix the car, God!

00:01:58.994 --> 00:02:02.206
- Take me, God! Bring me up to heaven now!

00:02:02.206 --> 00:02:03.281
- Hang in there!

00:02:03.281 --> 00:02:05.650
We're going to make it out of this, okay?

00:02:05.650 --> 00:02:08.951
(celestial singing)

00:02:08.951 --> 00:02:10.451
- I love you, man.

00:02:11.684 --> 00:02:14.622
(car drives by)

00:02:14.622 --> 00:02:16.500
- [Newscaster] Ladies and gentlemen,

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.516
we interrupt this program to
bring you some breaking news.

00:02:19.516 --> 00:02:21.780
Two men were recently found
dead on the side of the road

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:23.583
after experiencing some car trouble.

00:02:23.583 --> 00:02:26.884
The shocking thing is,
they were exactly .2 miles

00:02:26.884 --> 00:02:28.985
away from the nearest gas station.

00:02:28.985 --> 00:02:30.638
Back to you, Chris!

00:02:30.638 --> 00:02:33.888
(upbeat metallic rock)

